{"ticker":"FIEMIND","symbol":"FIEMIND","instrumentId":3099312,"name":"Fiem Industries","industry":"NSE-Auto/Truck-Original Eqp","about":"Fiem Industries Ltd. is a prominent player in the automotive component industry, specializing in the manufacturing of lighting systems, rear-view mirrors, and plastic components for two-wheelers, four-wheelers, and commercial vehicles. The company’s product portfolio includes LED headlamps, tail lamps, indicator lamps, and other advanced lighting solutions, catering to major Original Equipment Manufacturers (OEMs) in India and abroad. Fiem’s state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities and robust R&D capabilities enable it to deliver innovative, high-quality, and cost-effective products that enhance vehicle safety and aesthetics. Its commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction has established Fiem Industries as a trusted supplier in the automotive industry.","website":"www.fiemindustries.com","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:19:53.739Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":2174.9,"changePct":3.0562926459438966,"week52High":2645.9,"week52Low":1664.4},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹5,724 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹3,154 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"11,844,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"119"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"4,654,727"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.84%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"4.71"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.01"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.32"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"26%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"20.21"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"15–26"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"21.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"61.28"},{"label":"Volume","value":"64,361"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"94,960"},{"label":"Master score","value":"57"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"84"},{"label":"Pri